Crate(IO.FileRead("/etc/hosts") refused by the grant to package boxy (IO.FileRead("/srv/")))
Crate(IO.FileRead("/etc/hosts") refused by the grant to package boxy (IO.FileRead("/srv/")))
Crate(allowed /srv/x) | Crate(IO.FileRead("/etc/hosts") refused by the grant to package boxy (IO.FileRead("/srv/")))
exit 0
